From 8b438349b6bd3d9b5a2f4cf4a7b7481b1062c68f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Artem Fesunenko <body051@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 16:06:58 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] display: Add lerdge_tft display for Lerdge TFT touch
 screens

Render the Klipper display and menu on the FSMC TFT of Lerdge boards as
a 16x6 character screen with touch buttons, with touch calibration
(TOUCH_CALIBRATE) and a mirror mode API that lets an external program
(such as a KlipperScreen instance on a virtual X display) draw on the
screen and receive touch and knob (encoder) events.  The menu lets the
display intercept key events for this.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
